---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy | ManNeeds" description="Privacy Policy for ManNeeds Pure Indian Kitchen Essentials.">
  <section class="section policy-section">
    <div class="container policy-container">
      <span class="badge badge-green">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: November 2026 · <strong>ManNeeds</strong></p>

      <div class="policy-card">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you browse, create an account, or place an order on ManNeeds (<strong>manneeds.in</strong> / <strong>manneeds.vercel.app</strong>), we collect only the details needed to fulfill your order: your name, mobile number, email address, shipping address, city, state, pincode, and order items.</p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To process, pack, and deliver your food orders across India.</li>
          <li>To send order confirmations, shipping updates, and post-delivery feedback requests via SMS, Email, or WhatsApp.</li>
          <li>To auto-fill your saved delivery address when you sign in via Google or Mobile OTP.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Payment Security</h2>
        <p>Online payments (UPI, Debit Cards, Credit Cards, Netbanking) are processed securely through <strong>Cashfree Payments</strong> over 256-bit SSL encryption. ManNeeds never stores your card numbers, CVV, or UPI PIN on our servers.</p>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We never sell or rent your personal data. We share delivery details solely with our courier partners and payment gateway (Cashfree) strictly to complete your order.</p>

        <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or data deletion requests, email <a href="mailto:manneedsgroup@gmail.com">manneedsgroup@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/919748973335">+91 97489 73335</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .policy-section { padding: 3rem 0 4.5rem; background: var(--bg-base); }
  .policy-container { max-width: 820px; }
  .policy-updated { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .policy-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .policy-card h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .policy-card p, .policy-card li { font-size: 0.94rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
  .policy-card ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .policy-card a { color: var(--mn-cta); font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 639px) { .policy-card { padding: 1.35rem; } }
</style>
